      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "断断续续的话语……\r\n但是，这些只言片语已经足够了。只需稍微进行联想——\r\n说不定，新宇宙在那天……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bf4852dc1836b6bb2a20fdbcc797ab3501fb4d8a493887ae3563bd82f99e3f2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
