      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……虽然能听得出来她的确有着某种目的……\r\n但我还是无法理解她到底在说什么。\r\n是某种无法用语言传达的内容吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb7b578bd34e0cc421a351686e6c7d975ea355acaa88791db5722e97adf7a2d2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
