      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e96a9d3995a47c52ee48c920",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "既然如此……这也正是彼此加深理解的机会。\r\n看起来新宇宙自己倒没什么特别想去的地方，\r\n我便带着她在学园之外四处游玩——",
      "source_fingerprint": "b94e8936654f8c1dead9319874fecfab9abc8a8394706db75eee7ce761fbb1c5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
