    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c910140035101c73e1d0f582",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——这些话语，诉说着新宇宙所感受到的寂寞。\r\n而其中含义……经过这段与她共度的时间，\r\n我也能推测个大概。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d14cfe69480712e831cf0e4a216d31f31e19efd31f410686c2e5c3f8fc6d4598",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105004.json",
      "json_path": [
