    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12ec41abdfa93baf06b0ce47",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙，并非是什么未知生命体。\r\n她仅仅是想要奔跑、想要通过奔跑与他人交流……\r\n然后，以这之后的某件事为目标的赛马娘而已。而且……",
      "source_fingerprint": "12b511935159a4498c115ef1fc9f829549d96288b3c618903dc2e061aff4535e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd887a968af9a2c7617a2bbc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你是在……“追求”“连接”吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b1380f6c1b2d50f3e204278895a9899db4e5bb163a6f9ecc3201e646f5a9e85",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
