      "uid": "zhcn:3d33363109e3de5368da5b61",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "仅仅是因为他人无法理解她的话语，\r\n她便被阻拦在了梦想的起跑线之前。\r\n实在是令人惋惜不已……",
      "source_fingerprint": "db5706c752089a9b129c89c20009b0a7710aa1d080600ad9aaa73bbe3e377bef",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
