    {
      "uid": "zhcn:506fe08a9d4e57e5cf4f5e42",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我仍然无法理解眼前这位少女的追求，\r\n自然也无法知晓这对她而言意味着什么。\r\n但是——",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b03d7d9288440496d280a98302aba021988d8e4895f1d374702ec43fbfd0779",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105004.json",
      "json_path": [
