      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她祈愿着，想要抵达她梦想的终点。这就足够了。\r\n这样的话，便是时候由他人主动与她连接了——",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ca35a0371c6244c596f985e56cf298d66f5f641c7e197f3f2c912564e25b92c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
